### 2. Bug Code Snippets Analysis & Bug Location

- The relevant code is in `core/gather/navigation-runner.js`, specifically in `_computeNavigationResult`.
- The code currently only attaches the trace and devtools log to the artifacts if a page load error occurs, and only under special keys (`pageLoadError-...`). If the rest of the pipeline expects them under standard keys, this will cause the "Required traces gatherer did not run" error.
- The code should always ensure that the trace and devtools log artifacts are present in the expected locations, even in error cases.

